#### A. the create leg on an occupied visible target (bob holds read on /team) ####

== mkdir /team exist_ok=True as bob ==  success=True
  OBS  /team kind=directory {'status': 'unchanged', 'version': 1}

== mkdir /team as bob ==  success=False
  ERR  kind=vfs.exists severity=error path=/team message='Already exists'

== mkdir /team/plan.md (a file) as bob ==  success=False
  ERR  kind=vfs.exists severity=error path=/team/plan.md message='Already exists'

== mkdir /team/sub/x.md (tombstoned, visible) as bob ==  success=False
  ERR  kind=vfs.not_found severity=error path=/team/sub/x.md message='Not found'

== write /team/sub/x.md (revive) as bob ==  success=False
  ERR  kind=vfs.permission_denied severity=error path=/team/sub/x.md message='Permission denied'

#### B. the read leg: copy from a source the caller may only read into a prefix it may create in ####

== copy /team/plan.md -> /mine/plan.md as bob ==  success=True
  OBS  /mine/plan.md kind=file {'size_bytes': 18, 'status': 'created', 'version': 1}

== read /mine/plan.md as bob ==  success=True
  OBS  /mine/plan.md kind=file {'content': 'body /team/plan.md', 'content_hash': '58d82a34415d93070e2f58bcf0842e0192e724cded4565d8a54927a912f77eac', 'created_at': datetime.datetime(2026, 10, 15, 0, 8, 10, 121491), 'deleted_at': None, 'mime_type': None, 'render_status': None, 'size_bytes': 18, 'source': 'text', 'updated_at': datetime.datetime(2026, 10, 15, 0, 8, 10, 121491), 'version': 1}
   (today lawful: read >= read. Under the ladder the same leg passes a `list` source: no compile is consulted.)

#### C. anonymous under a `none` root with an `open` posture at /scratch (today) ####

== anon write /scratch/hello.txt ==  success=False
  ERR  kind=vfs.unauthenticated severity=error path=None message='Unauthenticated'

== anon ls /scratch ==  success=False
  ERR  kind=vfs.unauthenticated severity=error path=None message='Unauthenticated'

== anon ls / ==  success=False
  ERR  kind=vfs.unauthenticated severity=error path=None message='Unauthenticated'

== anon glob /** ==  success=False
  ERR  kind=vfs.unauthenticated severity=error path=None message='Unauthenticated'

-- the same calls as a named nobody (no grants) --

