  OBS  /scratch kind=directory {'content_hash': None, 'created_at': datetime.datetime(2026, 10, 15, 0, 8, 10, 76210), 'deleted_at': None, 'mime_type': None, 'render_status': None, 'size_bytes': None, 'source': 'text', 'updated_at': datetime.datetime(2026, 10, 15, 0, 8, 10, 76210), 'version': 1}

== zed glob /** ==  success=True
  OBS  /scratch kind=directory {'content_hash': None, 'created_at': datetime.datetime(2026, 10, 15, 0, 8, 10, 76210), 'deleted_at': None, 'mime_type': None, 'render_status': None, 'size_bytes': None, 'source': 'text', 'updated_at': datetime.datetime(2026, 10, 15, 0, 8, 10, 76210), 'version': 1}
  OBS  /scratch/old.md kind=file {'content_hash': '2be5889de0b5cb1bf52c14d7b4927ba32d7949b719cf9b7d851bd80eb3a229e7', 'created_at': datetime.datetime(2026, 10, 15, 0, 8, 10, 76210), 'deleted_at': None, 'mime_type': None, 'render_status': None, 'size_bytes': 20, 'source': 'text', 'updated_at': datetime.datetime(2026, 10, 15, 0, 8, 10, 76210), 'version': 1}

== zed write /scratch/hello.txt ==  success=True
